    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cohalan Downing are delighted to present this spacious 2-bedroom with home office, Ground floor apartment  which is situated in the highly desirable bellair complex a great location within walking distance of Cork City Centre.\r\n\r\nLocated just off Bellair on the Douglas Road, the property forms part of a small, gated development of apartments and duplex units totalling 20 in all.\r\n\r\nNo 6 would suit investors, first time buyers or those wishing to downsize and are looking for an\r\nextremely convenient location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 4.5m x 1.0m \r\nWood flooring\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area - 5.3m x 4.6m \r\nWood flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.3m x 1.9m \r\nRange of eye level fitted kitchen units, stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nHome office - 2.3m x 2.10m \r\nWood flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.1m \r\nWood flooring, fitted wardrobe, sliding door to rear\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 2.05m \r\nWood flooring, fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.2m x 1.7m \r\nWC, wash hand basin, bath with shower, tiled walls and floor\r\n\r\nRear Yard\r\nside access with maintenance free rear"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Walking distance of Cork city Centre & Douglas village\r\nGated development\r\nAmple on-site parking\r\nElectric storage heaters\r\nSeparate home office\r\nSide Access"
      },
